    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33475" root="فرز" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُرْزَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A road in,</i> or <i>upon, an</i> [<i>eminence such as
is termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَمَة</span>; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِرْزٌ</span></b> . (Ibn-'Abbád, O,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرْزٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُرْصَةٌ</span>, i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوْبَةٌ</span>
[meaning <i>A turn;</i> or <i>time at which,</i> or <i>during
which, a thing is,</i> or <i>is to be, done,</i> or <i>had, in succession</i>]. (O, K. *)

